I go out into the kitchen.
I would like something warm to drink.
I boil water for tea.
I make a large cup of herbal tea.
The water is very hot.
I take my tea into the living room.
I sit down on the sofa.
It is a dark winter evening.
I hold the warm cup in my hands.
I quickly get warm.
I listen to the wind outside.
It is blowing a lot.
The weather is wild tonight.
But it is very cozy in here.
The lamp shines softly in the corner.
I take a sip of my tea.
It tastes like mint.
The long day is over.
Now I relax.
